        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Coco Crochet started with a single hook and a skein of yarn. Today, every order is still made the same way: one loop at a time, by hand, especially for you. Because your order is made to order, please allow a few days of crafting time — good things take time.</p>",
